{"type":"standard","title":"William Lawrence (activist)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">William Lawrence (activist)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q139856023","titles":{"canonical":"William_Lawrence_(activist)","normalized":"William Lawrence (activist)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">William Lawrence (activist)</span></span>"},"pageid":83093915,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/William_Lawrence_2026.jpg/330px-William_Lawrence_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":412},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/William_Lawrence_2026.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1918,"height":2393},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375699782","tid":"ac726434-b42a-11f1-800a-5f4ce8d2001e","timestamp":"2026-09-19T13:04:40Z","description":"American activist (born 1990)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Lawrence_(activist)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Lawrence_(activist)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Lawrence_(activist)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:William_Lawrence_(activist)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Lawrence_(activist)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/William_Lawrence_(activist)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Lawrence_(activist)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:William_Lawrence_(activist)"}},"extract":"William Lawrence is an American politician and activist who co-founded the Sunrise Movement, a climate action organization. A progressive Democrat, he is a member of the Working Families Party and a former member of the Democratic Socialists of America. He is the Democratic nominee for the U.S. House of Representatives in Michigan's 7th congressional district in 2026.","extract_html":"<p><b>William Lawrence</b> is an American politician and activist who co-founded the Sunrise Movement, a climate action organization. A progressive Democrat, he is a member of the Working Families Party and a former member of the Democratic Socialists of America. He is the Democratic nominee for the U.S. House of Representatives in Michigan's 7th congressional district in 2026.</p>"}